From: Emerald Tablet <emeraldtablet@local>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 20:50:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] iOS: polish physical input and display

Purpose: Slow touch panning, consume navigation gestures before construction, keep iOS fullscreen, avoid the software keyboard with attached hardware, finish drained intro video, and offer persistent crisp scaling.

Affected platforms: iOS and iPadOS behavior only; shared renderer declarations remain inert elsewhere.

Upstream status: Candidate after physical acceptance; native menu preferences remain Emerald Tablet specific.

Tests: Clean patch reconstruction, repository safety scan, hermetic engine suite, Simulator/device builds and audits, preservation-safe physical iPad install and launch.
